WEBVTT

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:10.469
Everyone is acknowledging that you are
the first founder and looking at you.

00:00:10.677 --> 00:00:14.515
Who are you? Is this Psycho Helmet-san?

00:00:14.723 --> 00:00:19.144
How do you like all that clapping and
cheering you've never experienced before?

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:22.648
Well? Doesn't it feel great?

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.150
No, not at all.

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:31.323
Let's talk face to face.
I'm at the base of the broccoli.

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:35.285
Damn it, it's not a broccoli anymore.

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:39.456
Because this thing absorbed all
those emotions from those people,

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:42.543
it turned into something
completely different.

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:46.797
Have you ever strongly
believed in something?

00:00:47.881 --> 00:00:55.138
The aggregation of powerful belief
can sometimes manifest into reality.

00:00:55.347 --> 00:00:58.850
A great change is about
to happen in this world.

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:03.272
A new god named Psycho Helmet

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:07.734
is going to take physical form and ascend.

00:01:07.943 --> 00:01:09.653
God?

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:12.197
You're just a coordinator for this group.

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:18.745
I'm going to claim that Psycho Helmet
is the reincarnation of their great creator.

00:01:19.913 --> 00:01:25.544
I will lead the people down the right
path and give their hearts peace.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:27.754
The right path?

00:01:27.963 --> 00:01:31.800
Is giving people peace of mind even effective?

00:01:32.009 --> 00:01:34.845
Who the hell knows?
I'm just making shit up.

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:40.934
Just pray five minutes a day
towards the Divine Tree.

00:01:41.143 --> 00:01:44.563
That becomes my sustenance.

00:01:46.815 --> 00:01:52.321
The followers will figure out the rest for me
with however they interpret this.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:58.702
You look like you have
something you want to say.

00:01:58.910 --> 00:02:03.457
But look, the believers are
all having a great time, too.

00:02:03.665 --> 00:02:06.418
Including Ritsu and Reigen...

00:02:07.628 --> 00:02:10.505
Whoops. He was an exception, though.

00:02:10.714 --> 00:02:15.469
He figured me out before anyone else
and tried to shut all this down first.

00:02:15.677 --> 00:02:19.681
In the end, the ones
who have the most fun win.

00:02:20.557 --> 00:02:26.438
So you're the one who had
Master Reigen say that...

00:02:26.647 --> 00:02:28.231
...Dimple.

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:37.866
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:38.075 --> 00:02:42.954
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

00:02:43.997 --> 00:02:46.500
I realized that my youth was grey

00:02:46.708 --> 00:02:49.461
The root of this irritation is unknown

00:02:49.670 --> 00:02:51.963
My brain runs parallel with this emotional train

00:02:52.172 --> 00:02:55.175
Struggling adolescence

00:02:55.384 --> 00:02:58.011
