00:03:01.056 --> 00:03:04.476
Opposing ideas, distortion

00:03:04.685 --> 00:03:08.105
Purge the sorrow

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:11.650
So, do what you can now.

00:03:11.858 --> 00:03:13.777
My life

00:03:13.985 --> 00:03:14.820
Finally

00:03:15.028 --> 00:03:19.074
Break it down!!

