(BURN) they begin to sprout (1) within my chest

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:27.582
(TRANCE) I won't awaken (CHANCE) but I want to

00:03:27.791 --> 00:03:30.544
(STANCE) both sides of the coin
(1) are back-to-back

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:33.338
Accept me as I am

00:03:33.547 --> 00:03:36.550
Conflicting freedom and relations

00:03:36.758 --> 00:03:38.719
If they can become one

00:03:38.927 --> 00:03:40.345
That smile will be

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:42.180
One and only "1"

00:03:42.389 --> 00:03:47.769
MOB MOB WOW! MOB MOB WOW!

