00:04:04.703 --> 00:04:07.372
Now, don't be so mad.

00:04:07.581 --> 00:04:09.958
Hanazawa's fine.

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:13.837
More importantly,
join the Psycho Helmet Religion.

00:04:14.045 --> 00:04:18.675
You and I can stand at the top
and have a blast together.

00:04:18.884 --> 00:04:19.843
Why?

00:04:20.051 --> 00:04:24.765
By the looks of it,
you're already powerful enough.

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:27.851
You still have potential to grow.

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:33.231
Looking at the future, I figured it'd be
a waste not to take advantage of that power.

00:04:33.440 --> 00:04:35.066
I refuse.

00:04:36.943 --> 00:04:39.821
Well, I figured that'd be
your answer for now.

00:04:40.030 --> 00:04:45.160
But your family, your friends,
and everyone else

00:04:45.368 --> 00:04:49.414
already live in a world where
they experience happiness

00:04:49.623 --> 00:04:52.751
through their faith in Psycho Helmet-sama.

00:04:52.959 --> 00:04:58.840
You're the only one left behind
in this city, Shigeo.

00:04:59.049 --> 00:05:01.843
No one's ever coming back.

00:05:02.052 --> 00:05:04.679
How long are you gonna be stubborn?

00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:10.060
They're all just being brainwashed by you.
You're the one who needs to give up.

00:05:10.268 --> 00:05:11.728
You mad?

00:05:11.937 --> 00:05:13.647
I am.

00:05:13.855 --> 00:05:15.607
Of course I'm mad.

00:05:15.816 --> 00:05:18.151
Return everyone to their senses now.

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.403
You even got to Ritsu and Master Reigen...

00:05:20.612 --> 00:05:22.864
How did you manage that?

00:05:23.073 --> 00:05:26.409
The first stage was to have them
touch the Divine Tree

00:05:26.618 --> 00:05:29.996
or have them ingest a bit of it somehow.

00:05:30.205 --> 00:05:34.251
I got into their minds
through physical contact.

00:05:34.459 --> 00:05:41.007
The second stage was to expose the few
left behind to the passion of the masses.

00:05:41.216 --> 00:05:43.426
That's how I got to Reigen, too.

00:05:43.635 --> 00:05:46.972
He was overwhelmed by his surroundings.

00:05:47.889 --> 00:05:51.518
And now, we've entered the third stage.

00:05:51.726 --> 00:05:57.941
That strong feeling of faith
transmits from one person to another.

00:05:58.149 --> 00:06:03.864
It's only a matter of time till everyone
in the country believes in Psycho Helmet.

00:06:04.072 --> 00:06:06.449
Then it'll really be something.

00:06:06.658 --> 00:06:10.453
Then I'll truly become a new god.

00:06:10.662 --> 00:06:15.584
I don't really get all this, but becoming
a god is even more pointless.

00:06:15.792 --> 00:06:18.336
Do you really not understand
what you're doing?

00:06:18.545 --> 00:06:19.671
Huh?

00:06:19.880 --> 00:06:22.299
The whole city's a mess.

00:06:22.507 --> 00:06:23.508
The city?

00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:23.758
"Unnatural Deterioration of Home"
The city?

00:06:23.758 --> 00:06:23.967
"Unnatural Deterioration of Home"

00:06:23.967 --> 00:06:25.886
"Unnatural Deterioration of Home" I didn't know
that, but we can just rebuild it all later.

00:06:25.886 --> 00:06:28.597
I didn't know that, but we can
just rebuild it all later.

00:06:28.805 --> 00:06:31.725
That's enough.
Just undo their brainwashing.

00:06:31.933 --> 00:06:36.730
This isn't like you. You're being
very sentimental and narrow-minded.

00:06:36.938 --> 00:06:40.734
You keep calling it brainwashing,
but it's actually not that bad.

00:06:40.942 --> 00:06:43.737
It's not like I changed
any of their personalities,

00:06:43.945 --> 00:06:47.282
much less their hobbies
or the things they like.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:49.034
The way that Ritsu, Reigen,

00:06:49.242 --> 00:06:54.122
and everyone in the Body Improvement Club
feel about you isn't going to change, either.

00:06:54.331 --> 00:06:58.752
You're all just going to become followers
of the Psycho Helmet Religion.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:06.426
And... you'll feel happiness in that and be able
to share that happiness with other believers.

00:07:06.635 --> 00:07:11.389
I'm not trying to exclude you
from the fun here.

00:07:11.598 --> 00:07:15.185
So... what, exactly, is your problem?

00:07:16.353 --> 00:07:18.813
What am I doing wrong?

00:07:21.858 --> 00:07:23.985
What are you doing wrong?

00:07:24.194 --> 00:07:27.322
Dimple, you're playing dirty.

00:07:27.530 --> 00:07:30.367
You're controlling people's hearts
with your power.

00:07:30.575 --> 00:07:34.579
That means they can't defy you and you
can make them do whatever you want.

00:07:34.788 --> 00:07:41.252
We live in a world where there are laws and
societal norms that we can't defy to begin with.

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:45.298
If you're oblivious to them,
you don't have any problems.

00:07:45.507 --> 00:07:48.134
Not to mention, should I not listen to you,

00:07:48.343 --> 00:07:51.763
won't you just resort to force
at the end of the day?

00:07:51.972 --> 00:07:53.974
Sure, but I don't have a choice...

00:07:54.182 --> 00:07:58.520
Because my family and friends
are being brainwashed.

00:07:58.728 --> 00:08:03.024
Believe it or not, I'm restraining
myself quite a bit right now.

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:05.026
Wait, Kageyama-kun.

00:08:05.235 --> 00:08:09.280
What Dimple-kun's doing isn't exactly evil.

00:08:09.489 --> 00:08:10.198
What?

00:08:10.407 --> 00:08:11.950
Think about this rationally.

00:08:12.158 --> 00:08:16.287
If you choose violence just because
you don't agree with him, it's over.

00:08:16.496 --> 00:08:19.249
No, there's still time.

00:08:19.457 --> 00:08:23.294
The Psycho Helmet Religion
still hasn't officially begun.

00:08:23.503 --> 00:08:26.673
No. If you put your hands on him,
it's all over.

00:08:26.881 --> 00:08:29.634
Your relationship with Dimple-kun...

00:08:29.843 --> 00:08:33.263
Our friendship will all be over.

00:08:33.471 --> 00:08:38.393
If you're going to forcibly tear
apart the Psycho Helmet Religion,

00:08:38.601 --> 00:08:40.979
I'm going to stop you.

00:08:41.187 --> 00:08:43.273
Even if you defeat me,

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:47.360
your little brother and Reigen-san aren't
going to let you get away with this.

00:08:47.569 --> 00:08:51.239
Eventually, everyone will stand in your way.

00:08:51.448 --> 00:08:54.534
Dimple, you...

00:08:54.743 --> 00:08:57.287
Hanazawa doesn't have
any bad intentions, either.

00:08:57.495 --> 00:09:01.207
He's just trying to get you to change
your mind because he truly cares about you.

00:09:01.416 --> 00:09:05.045
I told you, even if you don't do anything,
everyone's daily lives--

00:09:07.505 --> 00:09:11.634
Dimple, come out.
I want to talk to you face to face.

00:09:11.843 --> 00:09:13.887
Stop this, Kageyama-kun!

00:09:14.095 --> 00:09:17.140
We've been talking this whole time.

00:09:19.809 --> 00:09:23.354
If you're going to harm the Psycho
Helmet Religion or the Divine Tree,

00:09:23.563 --> 00:09:25.273
then you'll have to deal with me!

00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:41.039
Hanazawa-kun! Snap out of it!

00:09:41.247 --> 00:09:44.000
Unfortunately for you,
I'm not controlling him.

00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:46.628
I've just gained another
important thing in my life.

00:09:46.836 --> 00:09:50.882
I'm going to keep fighting you until
you give up and leave, Kageyama-kun!

00:09:53.009 --> 00:09:54.427
I'm sorry.

00:10:05.772 --> 00:10:07.857
Dimple, show yourself!

00:10:16.491 --> 00:10:19.786
Those who believe
are blessed with divinity.

00:10:19.994 --> 00:10:23.581
Hanazawa has godly powers right now.

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:27.168
I'm overflowing with power...

00:10:33.883 --> 00:10:37.512
Hana... zawa-kun...

00:10:38.721 --> 00:10:40.181
I'm sorry.

00:10:53.111 --> 00:10:57.157
Oh, no. I ended up hurting
the Divine Tree again.

00:10:57.365 --> 00:10:59.325
Well done, Hanazawa.

00:10:59.534 --> 00:11:03.705
Shigeo, if you let the Divine Tree's
roots embrace you and cool down,

00:11:03.913 --> 00:11:06.708
you'll change your mind, too.

00:11:08.751 --> 00:11:10.670
Such incredible power...

00:11:12.380 --> 00:11:14.549
The broccoli's roots?

00:11:21.472 --> 00:11:24.058
These roots are dangerous...

00:11:24.267 --> 00:11:27.020
Get away from here, Hanazawa-kun!

00:11:30.607 --> 00:11:32.317
Seriously, Kageyama-kun?!

00:11:32.525 --> 00:11:35.236
Psycho Helmet-sama, get behind me!

00:11:42.994 --> 00:11:47.749
W-Wow... You really are amazing!

00:11:54.088 --> 00:11:59.093
Aw, damn it. Now you opened
a hole in the Divine Tree.

00:11:59.302 --> 00:12:02.013
I mean, it'll close right back up anyway...

00:12:04.432 --> 00:12:10.897
I guess becoming a god
isn't so easy after all, Shigeo.

00:12:11.105 --> 00:12:12.523
It's futile.

00:12:29.582 --> 00:12:33.127
Dimple, why?

00:12:33.336 --> 00:12:36.047
Why won't you show yourself?

00:12:46.599 --> 00:12:48.309
Could it be...

00:12:51.479 --> 00:12:53.856
...you're scared of me?

00:13:18.089 --> 00:13:19.966
Are we going to continue?

00:13:22.093 --> 00:13:25.930
Enough. That's enough.

00:13:26.139 --> 00:13:28.891
Don't make me feel like this.

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:32.186
Don't you get it, Dimple?

00:13:33.688 --> 00:13:35.606
Come out, please.

00:13:37.191 --> 00:13:39.110
Or else...

00:14:11.684 --> 00:14:16.439
My powers... are being sucked away.

00:14:16.647 --> 00:14:18.816
Correct.

00:14:19.025 --> 00:14:22.528
You probably should've noticed
that a wee bit earlier.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:32.288
It was a mistake to let yourself
be lured into the Divine Tree.

00:14:39.087 --> 00:14:42.006
But your biggest mistake...

00:14:43.966 --> 00:14:47.637
...was defying me.

00:14:47.845 --> 00:14:51.224
Dimple... What's the meaning of this?!

00:14:51.432 --> 00:14:53.684
Cool your head a bit.

00:14:53.893 --> 00:14:57.688
If you're not gonna listen to me,
I might just get her to tell you.

00:14:57.897 --> 00:14:58.523
Huh?

00:14:58.731 --> 00:15:04.821
If I have Tsubomi-chan convince you,
maybe you'll finally cool off a bit.

00:15:05.029 --> 00:15:09.784
Mob-kun! You can't go causing trouble for
everyone in the Psycho Helmet Religion!

00:15:09.992 --> 00:15:12.245
Get a clue already!

00:15:12.453 --> 00:15:13.955
You know?

00:15:19.377 --> 00:15:21.003
Hey, now...

00:15:21.212 --> 00:15:27.176
You get so serious anytime
Tsubomi-chan is involved.

00:15:27.385 --> 00:15:30.096
While we're at it, I guess I'll
just finally break it to ya.

00:15:30.304 --> 00:15:34.183
Shigeo, you've got no chance with her.

00:15:34.392 --> 00:15:35.893
Huh?

00:15:38.479 --> 00:15:44.068
Takane Tsubomi is the type of person to
honestly say she doesn't want something.

00:15:44.277 --> 00:15:49.073
I tried to forcefully give her one of the
candies, but she batted his hand away.

00:15:50.032 --> 00:15:51.993
Even when I used her friends
to get through to her,

00:15:52.201 --> 00:15:54.662
she wasn't interested.

00:15:56.247 --> 00:15:57.290
She's a strong woman who
doesn't conform to others

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:00.251
"Yakisoba" "Grilled Corn" She's a strong
woman who doesn't conform to others

00:16:00.251 --> 00:16:00.460
"Yakisoba" "Grilled Corn"

00:16:00.460 --> 00:16:02.712
"Yakisoba" "Grilled Corn"
and lives by her own set of values.

00:16:02.712 --> 00:16:02.920
"Yakisoba" "Grilled Corn"

