"Yakisoba" "Grilled Corn"
No wonder she never even noticed you

00:16:05.131 --> 00:16:07.508
when you used your psychic
powers in front of her.

00:16:07.717 --> 00:16:13.473
Even if you get shredded,
I'm sure she'll never need you.

00:16:14.474 --> 00:16:20.646
But now... she's also part of
the Psycho Helmet Religion.

00:16:21.856 --> 00:16:28.279
Meaning you might just be able to win
her over as the great founder Shigeo.

00:16:30.281 --> 00:16:32.450
This is stupid.

00:16:32.658 --> 00:16:34.744
Wow...

00:16:34.952 --> 00:16:37.705
I thought we already took
most of your power...

00:16:37.914 --> 00:16:41.083
But I guess you've still got some left.

00:16:42.376 --> 00:16:47.340
Maybe I shouldn't have
shown myself just yet.

00:16:47.548 --> 00:16:52.929
Well, whatever. It's not like
I'd lose to you right no--

00:16:53.846 --> 00:16:55.431
W-Wait...

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:57.558
N-Now, wait a minute...

00:17:05.566 --> 00:17:07.568
Don't get ahead of yourself, damn it!

00:17:07.777 --> 00:17:10.530
This is how you repay my kindness?!

00:17:10.738 --> 00:17:15.576
I guess I'm just gonna have
to get serious, too.

00:17:23.084 --> 00:17:25.253
Watch closely.

00:17:25.461 --> 00:17:30.800
This... is the newly, happily reborn...

00:17:30.967 --> 00:17:31.008
"God Dimple"

00:17:31.008 --> 00:17:33.678
"God Dimple"
...Great God Dimple!

00:17:33.678 --> 00:17:33.719
"God Dimple"

00:17:33.886 --> 00:17:36.556
So what?

00:17:37.598 --> 00:17:39.058
Here I go!

00:17:41.519 --> 00:17:43.521
Godly Punch!

00:17:46.691 --> 00:17:48.776
Godly Dash!

00:17:50.570 --> 00:17:52.238
And then...

00:17:52.446 --> 00:17:55.366
...Godly Smash!

00:17:59.203 --> 00:18:01.789
Well? How do you like the power of God?

00:18:01.998 --> 00:18:03.791
You give up yet?

00:18:07.962 --> 00:18:10.214
Godly Throw!

00:18:13.384 --> 00:18:15.845
Godly...

00:18:16.053 --> 00:18:18.389
