00:18:29.734 --> 00:18:32.486
I'm very aware, Shigeo...

00:18:32.695 --> 00:18:37.033
...that this isn't enough to beat you.

00:18:39.702 --> 00:18:41.829
But you should be at your limit soon...

00:18:42.038 --> 00:18:47.501
The tremendous power that we sucked from him
is flowing into me through the Divine Tree.

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:51.297
I saw the limit of his power
when he fought Claw's boss.

00:18:51.505 --> 00:18:55.259
His power isn't endless. It's finite.

00:18:55.468 --> 00:18:59.180
He did almost lose to Mogami
Keiji's mental attacks, too.

00:18:59.388 --> 00:19:01.724
