00:19:27.208 --> 00:19:31.003
Then you shouldn't be holding back.

00:19:31.212 --> 00:19:35.841
Your powers, your actions, your words...

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:38.219
They're all fake.

00:19:38.427 --> 00:19:42.014
Don't try to convince me
that's the real Dimple.

00:19:42.223 --> 00:19:43.641
It's just...

00:19:43.849 --> 00:19:48.521
It doesn't suit you. I won't allow it.
I won't accept it.

00:19:52.066 --> 00:19:55.152
Who the hell do you think you are?!

00:19:55.361 --> 00:19:57.113
You won't accept it?!

00:19:57.321 --> 00:20:04.704
Don't go casually denying the thing
I've been wanting so badly!

00:20:04.912 --> 00:20:08.749
Godly Beam!

00:20:19.009 --> 00:20:22.346
Sh-Shit! I used too much energy!

00:20:22.555 --> 00:20:23.723
Shigeo--

00:20:25.307 --> 00:20:28.936
I-I can feel his rage.

00:20:32.022 --> 00:20:33.983
W-Wait, wait...

00:20:34.191 --> 00:20:39.905
That bastard still...
He still has this much power left?

00:20:44.201 --> 00:20:46.787
I need to finish him off
before he gets to me.

00:20:49.457 --> 00:20:51.834
That one was actually surprising.

00:20:52.042 --> 00:20:54.462
I might've almost died.

00:20:54.670 --> 00:20:58.340
A little more and I really
might lose all faith in you.

00:21:00.468 --> 00:21:04.722
This is terrifying...
He's glaring at me with those eyes.

00:21:04.930 --> 00:21:10.561
I just want to know how you
really feel. Say something, Dimple.

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.564
Don't give me that.

00:21:13.773 --> 00:21:19.653
I was trying to take advantage
of you from the start!

00:21:19.862 --> 00:21:23.199
I'm sad. So...

00:21:23.407 --> 00:21:25.201
...is this goodbye, Dimple?

00:21:25.409 --> 00:21:26.869
Is he coming at me?!

00:21:30.915 --> 00:21:36.045
Behold my full psychic strength!
I'm going to end this!

00:21:47.932 --> 00:21:49.934
Holy shit, that shirt is lame!

00:21:55.356 --> 00:21:57.566
There was a blue light shining

00:21:57.775 --> 00:22:00.027
I'm wide awake this 1:30 AM

00:22:00.236 --> 00:22:02.655
What remained even after I swiped

00:22:02.863 --> 00:22:06.492
Are the smiles of my friends right beside me

00:22:15.501 --> 00:22:17.711
Yes, I want someone to understand...

00:22:17.920 --> 00:22:20.256
This wish that's hidden colorless and invisible

00:22:20.464 --> 00:22:22.800
The breath I was holding deep within my heart

00:22:23.008 --> 00:22:25.469
I let it all out at once and return to my senses

00:22:25.678 --> 00:22:27.847
On days that I'm feeling apathetic
it suddenly comes to mind

00:22:28.055 --> 00:22:30.391
These seasons I spent as if they were a given

00:22:30.599 --> 00:22:32.893
Even if reality becomes sullied

00:22:33.102 --> 00:22:36.146
Only the sky we saw together is real

00:22:36.355 --> 00:22:38.274
This is more incomprehensible

00:22:38.482 --> 00:22:40.526
Than the grammar on the blackboard

00:22:40.734 --> 00:22:42.945
If it's going to disappear within 24 hours

00:22:43.153 --> 00:22:45.823
This flowing story is just too lonely

00:22:46.031 --> 00:22:47.741
I just can't do it

00:22:47.950 --> 00:22:49.952
Just like that back hip circle I gave up on

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:52.454
But I'm not going to...

00:22:52.663 --> 00:22:53.998
Give up

00:22:54.206 --> 00:22:55.791
My present anymore

00:22:56.000 --> 00:22:58.210
I adorn my overflowing emotions

00:22:58.419 --> 00:23:00.754
And run through my worries and hesitations

00:23:00.963 --> 00:23:03.257
It can't be decided from 0 to 100

00:23:03.465 --> 00:23:05.801
Draw the incomplete future with this hand

00:23:06.010 --> 00:23:08.262
We can't even prove its existence

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:11.473
But as the world stabs the middle of my chest

00:23:11.682 --> 00:23:14.768
It overflows with cobalt blue

00:23:23.319 --> 00:23:25.070
English Translator: Michelle Tymon Translation Editor:
Zachary Carlysle Translation Checker: Sriram Gurunathan

00:23:26.280 --> 00:23:29.533
Man, I never could relate to you, Shigeo.

00:23:29.742 --> 00:23:32.661
I should've been able to use our psychic
powers and had a better life.

00:23:32.870 --> 00:23:35.414
You really did know how to piss me off.

